  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/962",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>4월에는 환경 관련 날들이 많아 환경 수업 하기 좋습니다.<br>5일에 식목일, 그리고 식목일 전날인 4일에는 종이 안 쓰는 날,<br>22일에 지구의 날이 있어요.<br>&#160;<br>그리고 올해 새롭게 알게 된 개구리의 날이 마지막주 토요일에 있습니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43df4fb83bc1f1a75e33b16a3df12f0c9246ffd8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43df4fb83bc1f1a75e33b16a3df12f0c9246ffd8\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1007\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cac8e39fef1ea9c3dda78f237ebb449124c98c3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cac8e39fef1ea9c3dda78f237ebb449124c98c3\" data-origin-width=\"700\" data-origin-height=\"389\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>동아리 수업 전에 아이들에게 개구리 날에 대해, 그리고 개구리의 멸종 위기에 대해 조사해 오도록 했고요.<br>&#160;<br>유&#53933;에서 &#39;점핑 개구리&#39; 검색해서<br>영상보면서 함께 따라 접었어요.<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NBy8YDAFAf0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">(12) 2배로 멀리뛰는 반반개구리 접는방법(종이접기) / 네모아저씨 (Origami 2x Jumping Frog) - YouTube</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NBy8YDAFAf0\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/k6Aed/hyNYGZnjVv/kJe2vA0dA2udOIpeGaVB9k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NBy8YDAFAf0\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>그리고 리얼하게 생긴 종이 개구리도 접었어요.<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cnj-tsRmLn0&amp;t=4s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">(12) 색종이로 개구리 접는방법(종이접기) / 네모아저씨(Origami Frog) / &#2323;&#2352;&#2367;&#2327;&#2366;&#2350;&#2368; &#2347;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2327; / 折り紙カエル - YouTube</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cnj-tsRmLn0\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/UmDss/hyNYCo8MqC/oss8USguAu7VKheBNTtSlK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cnj-tsRmLn0\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160; <br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0a2b8042f7ff8bb3d2e003b020c14480c43cfb0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0a2b8042f7ff8bb3d2e003b020c14480c43cfb0\" data-origin-width=\"2016\" data-origin-height=\"1512\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>제가 접은 개구리입니다.<br>파랑 종이로 접으니 진로 두꺼비가 됐네요.<br> <br>개구리 점핑 대회로 우수자 뽑기하고 즐거운 시간 보낸뒤에</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/435cc707818db5f80211f385a5f52527a687391c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/435cc707818db5f80211f385a5f52527a687391c\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/744806260c0f63bff9bb99b490f1d7b75fcc8bb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/744806260c0f63bff9bb99b490f1d7b75fcc8bb4\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e87356316daf37fc95b5f5914e69325ebf94dcf7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e87356316daf37fc95b5f5914e69325ebf94dcf7\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f40b70036a6da2fb3b82031f7142485ffe2fbf4f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f40b70036a6da2fb3b82031f7142485ffe2fbf4f\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f9c11565455b4b5392cff3a7d950efff050233cd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f9c11565455b4b5392cff3a7d950efff050233cd\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c55cf3338f846753b147d49e69462948c4cdcd31\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c55cf3338f846753b147d49e69462948c4cdcd31\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a46fca4a39bf22a70a1e2348a3c24f6f8b8fc619\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a46fca4a39bf22a70a1e2348a3c24f6f8b8fc619\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>이면지를 사용해서 개구리혀를 만들고 그곳에 개구리의 날 홍보문구를 넣었어요.<br> <br>아이들과 학교 밖으로 나가 풀밭에 개구리를 놓아주었어요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/420ec5bfe61f2b41ab4404a14e152e9c265ad7e6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/420ec5bfe61f2b41ab4404a14e152e9c265ad7e6\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a60b41c5780b29aada07ca29b61bc4485ae7943\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a60b41c5780b29aada07ca29b61bc4485ae7943\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4eddab15e700e9df73c0a40c41f959ff3c9feee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4eddab15e700e9df73c0a40c41f959ff3c9feee\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/efbaf7da1a5c8f9cb28373c7ba5301685d253b51\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/efbaf7da1a5c8f9cb28373c7ba5301685d253b51\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/89de7e23c5ca9f1c50cd610ed646b2b7facf569c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/89de7e23c5ca9f1c50cd610ed646b2b7facf569c\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e9061d9b5a3d368c74223d74bd2b48e52da0064\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e9061d9b5a3d368c74223d74bd2b48e52da0064\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83c160a8267b1bc0d5e48288acc81716ff4a29b1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83c160a8267b1bc0d5e48288acc81716ff4a29b1\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f4d5d95f8df88e9fbab1cd9760d1178f0c24d19\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f4d5d95f8df88e9fbab1cd9760d1178f0c24d19\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>아이들과 헤어지고 돌아오는 길에 보니<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d62014aacfab2c2dcccda6b2930c057c92f004e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d62014aacfab2c2dcccda6b2930c057c92f004e\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c38ee0bacc4d9b39010c9ea6557a0b6e3c9aa9a1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c38ee0bacc4d9b39010c9ea6557a0b6e3c9aa9a1\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85dd2d6502b635669e5d686dc54e1fe8e8074110\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85dd2d6502b635669e5d686dc54e1fe8e8074110\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>초등학생 둘이 개구리를 발견하고는 발걸음을 멈추고 글을 읽더라고요~&#128536;&#128525;<br><br>사진찍어서 동아리 아이들에게 알려줬더니 너무 뿌듯해 했어요~<br><br>환경지표생물인 개구리가 살기 어려운 환경이 된다는 것은 결국 우리 인간들도 살기 어려워진다는 이야기다~<br>다음 동아리 날까지 우리집을 잘 관찰해서 기후위기 대응으로 잘 실천하고 있는 행동과 개선해야할 행동을 파악해와라~하며 수업 마무리 했어요.<br>&#160;<br>개구리의 날인 마지막주 토요일 전날 금욜엔<br>학교 복도에 숨겨져있는 종이 개구리를 찾아오는 사람에게 선물 주기로 했어요~<br>그 때 개구리의 날에 대해 다시 상기하고 기후위기 심각성을 알리려고 합니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
